The direct wait driver (crates/blaze-core/src/wait/direct.rs, added on branch all-1110 by
6835aa3360) moved onto blaze-sys: its real kernel (`Kernel`) makes blaze-sys's raw system
calls and calls no libc function. Written against all-1110's file; this branch (bstd-s1-1109)
does not have the file, so the move is kept here as a patch. Apply it once the branches meet
(`git apply crates/blaze-core/patches/wait-direct-on-blaze-sys.patch`), then delete this file
and take `wait/direct.rs` off the ban list in harness/v2/nostd.json.
Design: docs/v2/plan/design/sys.md, "Migration". Not built or run.

